When you wield a dead cockatrice and bash monsters with it, they still do
turn into stone ***without the hissing*** The effects of a cockatrice is
by touch only. Hence when the cockatrice actually hits you, you must make
a savings throw vs. petrification. Apparently the more and better armour
you wear,  the better your chances of surviving.

